   194	    tier="big" (auditors, judges, label verification) -> codex gpt-6.1-sol first (medium effort), falls back to luna — check r["model"] so auditor comparisons stay same-model.
   195	    tier="cheap" (simulated agents, paraphrasing) -> keyed -> Go -> codex gpt-6-luna.
   196	    backend="claude", model="claude-opus-5-5"|"claude-sonnet-5-5" -> Claude (cross-family auditor).
